%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-numbers-functions-toradixnumber (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import toRadixNumber from dw::core::Numbers
output application/json
---
{
    a: toRadixNumber(2, 2),
    b: toRadixNumber(255, 16)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": "10",
  "b": "ff"
}
